{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the near future, the global entertainment corporation Captive Dreams is launching a brand-new reality show called Bondage Arena, in which women from all over Earth\u2014and beyond\u2014battle for the amusement of millions. They wield special weapons\u2014Restrictors\u2014that, on impact, bind the target or inflict other effects (sleep, arousal).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bondage Arena is a first- or third-person shooter that plunges you into the world of your wildest bondage/BDSM fantasies. With over 20 richly detailed maps and a huge variety of modes, teams of women come equipped with unique outfits, skills, personalities, and appearances. You can even create your own teams and fighters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And once the match ends, your freedom doesn\u2019t\u2014choose from more than 200 different restraints, binding furniture, punishment poses, sex toys, and much more\u2026</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The very first bondage shooter ever!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Play from first- or third-person perspective across multiple meticulously crafted arenas. <br>\u2022 Wield both firearms and melee weapons, plus grenades and mines. <br>\u2022 Each weapon has three fire modes\u2014Binding, Arousal, and Sedation\u2014any of which can neutralize your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738510/extras/bb0f42215c379fd24cdc9ade75446254.poster.avif?t=1772140773\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738510/extras/bb0f42215c379fd24cdc9ade75446254.webm?t=1772140773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738510/extras/bb0f42215c379fd24cdc9ade75446254.mp4?t=1772140773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 <br>\u2022 Build structures (including automated turrets) and use stealth weapons that trigger special takedown animations when activated from behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738510/extras/5379c374c323634bbeeb21e0f9cce61c.poster.avif?t=1772140773\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738510/extras/5379c374c323634bbeeb21e0f9cce61c.webm?t=1772140773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738510/extras/5379c374c323634bbeeb21e0f9cce61c.mp4?t=1772140773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Punish the defeated!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your enemies lie bound at your feet, you\u2019ll have a vast arsenal of erotic punishment options: dozens of positions (many involving toys), the ability to strip captives naked, equip them with extra devices, and even fire orgasm-rounds, levitation rounds, magnet rounds, rope rounds, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738510/extras/daed34c1e1f1468fefa3135297493d83.poster.avif?t=1772140773\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738510/extras/daed34c1e1f1468fefa3135297493d83.webm?t=1772140773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738510/extras/daed34c1e1f1468fefa3135297493d83.mp4?t=1772140773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your captive on a leash, secure her to any of over 50 unique pieces of binding furniture\u2014each with its own animation. But be warned: if you lose, she\u2019ll do the same to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738510/extras/a38d9be39059c0dcaa9ae824825caa63.poster.avif?t=1772140773\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738510/extras/a38d9be39059c0dcaa9ae824825caa63.webm?t=1772140773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738510/extras/a38d9be39059c0dcaa9ae824825caa63.mp4?t=1772140773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ragdoll physics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy ultra-realistic collapses as captured foes sprawl under truly dynamic Ragdoll physics. Drag them by rope, launch flying drones, or simply blast them into the air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738510/extras/769646ddbd753601514a191d60cdbdf6.poster.avif?t=1772140773\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738510/extras/769646ddbd753601514a191d60cdbdf6.webm?t=1772140773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738510/extras/769646ddbd753601514a191d60cdbdf6.mp4?t=1772140773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless gameplay variety</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve packed the game with content you won\u2019t tire of. Over 20 locations set in different styles and eras\u2014battle on a pirate ship deck, a futuristic factory, a steampunk city, or a Western saloon. And we\u2019re always adding more maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738510/extras/b5992e383048a05647ab17f9e4e497f3.poster.avif?t=1772140773\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738510/extras/b5992e383048a05647ab17f9e4e497f3.webm?t=1772140773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738510/extras/b5992e383048a05647ab17f9e4e497f3.mp4?t=1772140773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The classic mode pits 2\u20136 teams against each other on one map: control a woman on your squad and bind every opponent. But that\u2019s just the beginning:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle Royale</strong>: Every woman for herself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Depravity Mode</strong>: Punish opponents mid-fight to earn points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo Purge</strong>: Sneak through the map alone, using stealth weapons to take down every foe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zombie Mode</strong>: Hold back relentless waves of zombie girls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival</strong>: Start alone, earn money by selling captured women while fending off raiders\u2014upgrade your weapons, fortify your base, hire mercenaries, and last as long as you can.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And much more</strong>\u2014we\u2019re constantly designing new modes.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Full customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from prebuilt teams or create your own. Customize team uniforms or each woman\u2019s outfit from hundreds of options. Tweak appearance, voice, personality, and preferences to make every fighter truly yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738510/extras/40f7718787849c58071665d3d9a3f848.poster.avif?t=1772140773\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738510/extras/40f7718787849c58071665d3d9a3f848.webm?t=1772140773\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738510/extras/40f7718787849c58071665d3d9a3f848.mp4?t=1772140773\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Observer mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch to cinematic cameras to watch AI-vs-AI battles, or enter spectator mode after your character is bound.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deep settings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of options let you tailor everything\u2014preferred restraint types, punishment poses, AI behavior, character appearance, and more\u2014organized into logical sections for easy navigation.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3738510?t=1772140773","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3738510?t=1772140773","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738510/7ffafb9c48f10c5f674113d03003ca7a4491fb9f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772140773","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738510/7ffafb9c48f10c5f674113d03003ca7a4491fb9f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772140773","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family